<title>USA: Butler completes grain systems unit sale.</title>
<headline>Butler completes grain systems unit sale.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Butler Manufacturing Co said Monday it completed the sale of its Grain Systems division to CTB Inc for about $34 million in cash.</p>
<p>Butler said the sale will result in an after-tax gain of about $13 million, or $1.70 a share. The net proceeds will be used to fun investments in Butler's core products businesses and share repurchases, the company said.</p>
<p>Butler provides pre-engineered building systems and specialty components and construction services.</p>
<p>	  ((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
